Scoped pixelize block filter

The option table, per-frame block-size rounding, partial edge blocks, truncating
unsigned average, min/max fills and unselected-plane copies in
src/video-ops/pixelize.ts follow libavfilter/vf_pixelize.c (pixelize_options,
pix_fmts, config_output, filter_frame, pixelize_slice, pixelize_avg8,
pixelize_min8, pixelize_max8), and the integer and flag option parsing follows
libavutil/opt.c (set_string_number, write_number).
Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
